# Snake App Theme & UI

Follow `docs/UI_UX_DESIGN_BRIEF.md` and `docs/APP_FLOW.md`.

## Palette (dark default)
- Primary: `#1FA87A` · Light: `#3ECF98` · Dark: `#14825C`
- Secondary / reward: `#F0A202`
- Danger: `#E85D4C`
- Surfaces: bg `#0B1F1A`, raised `#12352C`, board `#0F2A23`
- Text: primary `#F2F7F4`, secondary `#A8C4B8`

## UI rules
- One job per screen; Home is brand + Play CTA - not a dense dashboard
- Prefer tonal surfaces over heavy multi-layer shadows
- Radii: 16 screens/cards, 12 controls, 8 chips
- Avoid purple-indigo gradients, cream/terracotta stock looks, emoji-spam HUDs
- Motion: intentional (food pulse, score float, unlock) - not continuous glow noise
- Tap targets ≥ 48×48 on touch; keep contrast readable on the board

## When editing theme
- Put tokens in `lib/core/theme/` (or equivalent) - do not hardcode scattered hex in feature widgets
- Update `docs/UI_UX_DESIGN_BRIEF.md` if tokens change
